  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "For monkey, we can write<br /><br />Mg - T = Ma<br /><br />or M(g + a) = T &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;....(i)<br /><br />for suspended weight,<br /><br />T ≤ mg &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ....(ii)<br /><br />T ≤ 25 × 10 or 250 N [breaking strength]<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/IL0001898_AnsExp_1.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 238px;\" />​<br /><br />∴ &nbsp; &nbsp;Equation (i) becomes<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp;20.(10 + a) ≤ 250<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>⇒</mo> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mtext>a</mtext> <mo>≤</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>50</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mtext>or</mtext> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mtext>a</mtext> <mo>≤</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mtext>.</mtext> <mn>5</mn> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <msup> <mtext>m s</mtext> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </msup> </mrow> </math><br /><br />∴ a<sub>max</sub> = 2.5 m s<sup>-2</sup>",
    "image": null
